  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b0a307fc-da28-41b0-adc7-6c1c39291e2a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"256\"></strong></p>\n<h1>📜說明</h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2235e\"><strong>Cataclysm: Spellbooks</strong></span> 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm</a> 的共用擴充模組。</p>\n<p>目前此模組新增了總共 <strong>65</strong>&nbsp;種新法術，後續還計劃增加更多。本模組還新增了一個新的法術學派：<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><em>深淵</em></span></span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"> </span>與<span style=\"color:#843fa1\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"color:#34495e;text-decoration:underline\">機關術</span></em></span></span>。深淵學派包含了所有以 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">利維坦</span> 為基礎的法術，而機關術則啟發自 <span style=\"color:#34495e\">預兆者</span>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><em>注意：本模組仍在開發中，將會持續新增法術！</em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><em>注意 2：「玩家，請安裝 Azurelib。」開發者哀求道。隨後開發者倒地身亡。</em></span></strong></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ba372a\"><strong><em>注意 3：已不再支援 1.20.1。請勿逆向移植此模組，或上傳至任何網站。</em></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">如果您想查看預計新增的法術，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 頁面</a> 查看！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zY8fDYXz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_aeffb23a-0e37-44ba-9321-8e639672834e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"192\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SCprzpvhK8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_eefc4371-f197-4e88-a5ca-9d369c18f408.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"192\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">🔗連結</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8zY8fDYXz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7a4fcb4e-d28f-4544-b647-f1470c52b2ba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/SCprzpvhK8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1d1e389d-cf70-413b-a4f7-5d3cd5fbc578.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/0starocean0/Cataclysm_Spellbooks_1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks_1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/AceTheEldritchKing/Cataclysm_Spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c813cc04-ef46-4605-8c2e-a5ef231f42bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fcataclysm-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/descripti